  m_text: '<b>Victim: <color=red>Motley Armstrong</color></b>

    <b>Cause of death:</b>
    Blunt-force trauma to the skull.

    <b>Scene of the crime:</b> Alleyway next
    to the local dive and poker bar, One Eyed Jack''s.

    <b>Murder weapon:</b>
    Glass ashtray.


    <b>Suspects:</b>

    - <b><color=#cf657f>Valentine LaCoeur</color></b>

    -
    <b><color=#4d65b4>Trowel Burrage</color></b>

    - <b><color=#f9c22b>Almaz Filatov</color></b>

    -
    <b><color=#165a4c>Berghain Sauerbeck</color></b>'
