  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'work <b>undercover</b> at the bar next to the scene of the crime: One
    Eyed Jack''s. Play Texas Hold Em'' poker with the local townspeople to find out
    more about the victim and the circumstances surrounding his death. Look for <b>tells</b>
    that give away each player''s strategy. When a player is <b>bluffing</b>, their
    <b>movements or facial expressions</b> might reveal the true strength of their
    hand.


    When you <b>interact with the townspeople between poker games</b>,
    their <b>tells</b> might also help you figure out <b><color=red>who did it</color></b>.
    But, remember to choose your questions carefully! If your <b>cover is blown</b>,
    you fail the mission.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1a062ba1358d72142adbfebd4448f740, type: 2}
